.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt DTRACE_CLEAR 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtrace_clear
.Nd reset DTrace rings and counters
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn dtrace_clear void
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm drains every per-CPU ring, resets the sequence counter and the drop
counters, and releases the consumer event.
The caller must disable every
probe first.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EBUSY
At least one probe is still enabled.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
